Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.98,0:01:33.48,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fscx45\pos(33,270)}The Symphony Upon the Ship
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.73,0:01:35.77,italicstop,Announcement,0,0,0,,The fireworks will start soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.77,0:01:40.17,italics,Announcement,0,0,0,,Please enjoy the glamorous show that \Nwill spread across the night sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.60,0:01:43.49,italics,Announcement,0,0,0,,May this be a lovely memory for \Nthe last night of the cruise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.04,0:01:49.75,main,Yor,0,0,0,,For now, let's head to the third cargo room, \Nwhere the rubber boats are stored.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.75,0:01:51.50,main,Yor,0,0,0,,That's where the director is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.78,0:01:54.76,main,Yor,0,0,0,,We'll lower the boat from the emergency \Nexit at the front of the second deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.76,0:01:57.00,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Then, we'll have the rendezvous \Nship retrieve you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.46,0:01:59.71,main,Yor,0,0,0,,If possible, we should do \Nthis during the fireworks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.74,0:02:00.52,top,Vides,0,0,0,,What should we do with our extra time?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.20,0:02:02.27,main,Heymann,0,0,0,,Watch the fireworks?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.27,0:02:05.26,main,Vides,0,0,0,,No way. We're heading to the casino.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.26,0:02:08.39,main,Vides,0,0,0,,I'm gonna win big so I can kiss my \Njob as a civil servant goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.39,0:02:09.95,main,Heymann,0,0,0,,The director's gonna yell at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.09,0:02:13.40,main,Yor,0,0,0,,L-Let's keep our guard up as we proceed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.40,0:02:14.23,main,Grey,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.37,0:02:21.16,italics,Glasses,0,0,0,,Blue Lace No. 89 and Mermaid...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.41,0:02:23.98,italics,Glasses,0,0,0,,They're both famous perfumes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.98,0:02:28.25,italics,Glasses,0,0,0,,But the combination of those two scents, \Nas well as the woman without a scent...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.25,0:02:31.27,italics,Glasses,0,0,0,,One man, two women, and a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.72,0:02:34.54,italics,Glasses,0,0,0,,I've found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.93,0:02:38.73,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya loves fireworks!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.73,0:02:39.58,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.07,0:02:40.43,main,Random Boy,0,0,0,,Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.43,0:02:42.37,main,Random Boy,0,0,0,,I wanna look over there, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.08,0:02:46.35,main,Anya,0,0,0,,There are too many people. \NI can't see the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.15,0:02:53.92,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I wonder if we'll find Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.92,0:02:55.82,main,Loid,0,0,0,,It probably won't be that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.06,0:02:57.58,italics,Crowd,0,0,0,,I'm so excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.06,0:02:57.58,italicstop,Crowd,0,0,0,,Is it starting soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.58,0:03:00.68,italicstop,Crowd,0,0,0,,I'm going to propose to my \Ngirlfriend at the finale.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.69,0:03:01.56,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,There are so many excited voices that\N I can't tell if Mama is even around.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.10,0:03:00.39,italicstop,Crowd,0,0,0,,So excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.68,0:03:04.79,italicstop,Crowd,0,0,0,,I wonder when I should tell her that she's \Nmore beautiful than the fireworks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.05,0:03:02.77,italicstop,Crowd,0,0,0,,So excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.08,0:03:04.79,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,I'm going to have to \Nconcentwate to find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.98,0:03:11.78,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Those people could be assassins.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.11,0:03:14.31,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,To think their reach extends \Nall the way down here...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.31,0:03:15.29,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Let's go around them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.80,0:03:18.98,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,This way, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.98,0:03:22.10,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,All the routes to the \Nbow have been blocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.10,0:03:24.49,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Of course, I could defeat \Nthem and make my way through,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.49,0:03:26.28,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,but they might call for backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.28,0:03:28.59,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,They might also figure \Nout where we're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.59,0:03:30.16,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Let's head back up to the deck for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.16,0:03:31.23,main,Grey,0,0,0,,Is everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.54,0:03:35.96,main,Yor,0,0,0,,The director gave me a key \Nthat opens the crew corridors.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.96,0:03:39.22,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Let's sneak out via the roof or other \Npaths that other people wouldn't use.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.67,0:03:43.60,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I don't sense anyone here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.60,0:03:46.42,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Everyone's probably busy with \Nthe event, so we should be fine,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.42,0:03:48.27,main,Yor,0,0,0,,but let's do our best not to make any noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.27,0:03:49.76,main,Olka,0,0,0,,Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.76,0:03:51.28,main,Grey,0,0,0,,O-Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.28,0:03:52.25,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.76,0:04:04.08,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Th-That startled me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.08,0:04:07.01,main,Olka,0,0,0,,It's all right. Look at \Nthe pretty fireworks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.27,0:04:08.26,top,Yor,0,0,0,,Let's use this noise as a \Ndistraction to get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.34,0:04:18.51,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.20,0:04:22.22,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Hup!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.32,0:04:26.25,main,Grey,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.29,0:04:29.96,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Let's hurry over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.26,0:04:34.45,main,Sniper,0,0,0,,I see two with black hair. \NIs it the one holding the brat?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.45,0:04:37.76,italics,Glasses,0,0,0,,Yeah. If possible, take the baby \Nout while you're at it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.31,0:04:39.74,main,Sniper,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.14,0:04:49.04,italics,Sniper,0,0,0,,She dodged it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.07,0:04:56.92,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, dear... He dodged it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.96,0:05:13.99,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.99,0:05:14.97,main,Grey,0,0,0,,Miss!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.99,0:05:16.66,main,Olka,0,0,0,,I-I'm okay... I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.04,0:05:29.00,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I didn't feel their presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.00,0:05:30.31,main,Grey,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey, hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.66,0:05:33.60,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,They're all very strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.12,0:05:43.36,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,We won't be able to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.45,0:05:49.18,main,Sniper,0,0,0,,I won't miss this time. I'll kill you first.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.64,0:05:59.34,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,Honestly...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.34,0:06:02.02,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,I was wondering where you \Nwere wasting time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.34,0:06:03.75,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Director!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.75,0:06:06.20,italics,Glasses,0,0,0,,Tch. So she has friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.56,0:06:11.37,main,Yor,0,0,0,,You two, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.37,0:06:13.01,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Take shelter under that hatch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.01,0:06:14.24,main,Chinese Guy,0,0,0,,You're not getting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.20,0:06:21.69,main,Grey,0,0,0,,Miss, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.69,0:06:22.97,main,Scar guy,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.19,0:06:25.39,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Someone in my blind spot?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.69,0:06:33.45,main,Olka,0,0,0,,Zeb!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.81,0:06:42.82,main,Olka,0,0,0,,Zeb!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.04,0:06:48.16,main,Grey,0,0,0,,That hurt! Even with the \Nbulletproof vest on, that hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.16,0:06:48.55,top,Olka,0,0,0,,Don't push yourself so hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.89,0:06:50.42,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Nice, Mister Husband!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.42,0:06:51.23,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Hi-yah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.10,0:07:01.89,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I can breathe easier knowing \Nthat hatch won't open easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.18,0:07:07.01,main,Bomb Guy,0,0,0,,You think that did you any good? \NI'll blow you all to smithereens!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.23,0:07:33.21,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Pardon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.21,0:07:34.09,main,Blonde,0,0,0,,Tch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.63,0:07:38.21,main,Assassin,0,0,0,,Don't poke your body out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.55,0:07:41.02,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,Not good. The deck is getting quite dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.55,0:07:44.77,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,I'll need to properly sanitize it \Nand get rid of all the evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.54,0:07:56.29,main,Knife Guy,0,0,0,,You're mi—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.38,0:08:12.32,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,Could you try to finish them \Noff without making such a mess?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.32,0:08:14.15,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,It's becoming a pain to clean up after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.15,0:08:16.15,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Director! When did you...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.15,0:08:18.38,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm terribly sorry. I haven't \Nhad much time to consider that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.38,0:08:19.90,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,Well, I suppose that can't be helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.90,0:08:22.65,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,They all seem to be proficient killers, \Nincluding a number of outsiders
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.65,0:08:25.76,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,with unique fighting styles\Nwe haven't seen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.39,0:08:27.22,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.91,0:08:30.78,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,They are no match for us, the Garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.01,0:08:34.66,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,Having them all gathered in one \Nspot will work in our favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.66,0:08:36.16,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,Let us finish them all off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.78,0:08:43.87,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Wow! Now it's a red one!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.87,0:08:47.05,italics,Loud,0,0,0,,I don't know how you can be equally excited \Nby every single one that goes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.60,0:08:49.84,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Bravo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.59,0:09:05.45,main,Heymann,0,0,0,,Oh, crap, Vides! I won!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.90,0:10:06.00,italics,Poison Mist Guy,0,0,0,,This poison is enough to take a bear down!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.56,0:10:09.50,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Goodness! You're so rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.76,0:10:15.12,main,Esmeralda,0,0,0,,Esmerelda, the master of wire—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.98,0:10:18.22,main,Chakram,0,0,0,,I'm the king of chak—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.85,0:10:24.23,main,Host,0,0,0,,All right! The fireworks show \Nis reaching its climax!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.22,0:10:31.46,main,Yor,0,0,0,,That hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.46,0:10:33.11,main,Stun gun guy,0,0,0,,Just, "That hurt"?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.51,0:11:01.77,italics,Host,0,0,0,,And the party is finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.99,0:11:17.02,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I jammed my finger...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.58,0:11:29.96,main,Glasses,0,0,0,,Well, damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.24,0:11:34.46,main,Glasses,0,0,0,,You ended up killing all \Nof them, you awful woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.46,0:11:37.74,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Huh? Yes, I did kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.74,0:11:39.77,main,Yor,0,0,0,,It was only natural. I'm terribly sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.05,0:11:42.05,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Those who point their blade at another
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.05,0:11:44.64,main,Yor,0,0,0,,cannot complain when they \Nhave one pointed at them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.29,0:11:46.75,main,Yor,0,0,0,,That includes myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.75,0:11:49.21,main,Glasses,0,0,0,,You're so earnest. Well, no matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.21,0:11:51.76,main,Glasses,0,0,0,,This just means I get a \Nbigger cut of the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.05,0:11:53.56,main,Yor,0,0,0,,This might be a bit late to ask,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.56,0:11:56.09,main,Yor,0,0,0,,but would you consider just \Npeacefully going home?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.09,0:11:58.01,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'd rather not spill any \Nmore unnecessary blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.01,0:11:59.61,main,Jogger,0,0,0,,Who do you think you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.61,0:12:01.03,main,Glasses,0,0,0,,That's not going to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.38,0:12:03.51,main,Glasses,0,0,0,,We've already received a down payment,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.51,0:12:06.78,main,Glasses,0,0,0,,and it's not like we can go \Nhome when we're on a boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.78,0:12:10.69,main,Glasses,0,0,0,,I'm also pretty sure that old guy \Nover there isn't gonna let us leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.69,0:12:12.53,main,Yor,0,0,0,,You shouldn't glare at them \Nlike that, Director!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.06,0:12:17.11,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,This lot considers war just\Nanother way to get paid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.11,0:12:20.48,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,If we let them go, they will \Nharm our country somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.48,0:12:23.06,main,Glasses,0,0,0,,You're old-fashioned, Mister Soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.06,0:12:26.50,main,Glasses,0,0,0,,You should learn a thing or two \Nfrom the West. Money is power.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.50,0:12:28.55,main,Glasses,0,0,0,,Everyone's happy if we're all rich, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.55,0:12:32.63,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,To be a businessman, \Nyou truly lack foresight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.63,0:12:36.05,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,You can regret playing with fire \Nwhile the sharks are eating you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.40,0:12:39.85,main,Glasses,0,0,0,,Nah... You're the ones who're \Ngonna end up as shark bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.97,0:12:58.09,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Director!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.98,0:13:14.09,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,My grip strength...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.09,0:13:15.53,main,Katana Guy,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.27,0:13:30.27,main,Katana Guy,0,0,0,,Don't struggle. You're just \Ndrawing out your suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.77,0:13:33.10,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,He's on a different level than the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.62,0:13:36.23,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,My legs are heavy again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.04,0:13:43.38,flashback,Matthew,0,0,0,,In the event of your death or a wound too \Nsevere for a cover story to account for,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.38,0:13:46.88,flashback,Matthew,0,0,0,,I will tell Forger that you \Nhave been transferred.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.61,0:13:51.12,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,If I disappeared without saying a word...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.80,0:13:55.03,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,What an awful woman I would be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.51,0:14:05.16,main,Yor,0,0,0,,They'll be suspicious if I come home \Nwith a new hairstyle, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.45,0:14:07.74,main,Loid,0,0,0,,What?! You got a haircut\Nwhile entertaining guests?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.74,0:14:10.40,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Er, well, this was just how I dealt \Nwith them turning down our offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.75,0:14:13.90,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,No, now's not the time to \Nbe worrying about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.20,0:14:16.41,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,At this rate, I'm going to be sliced in two!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.18,0:14:30.68,main,Katana Guy,0,0,0,,Little girl, if you're afraid\Nof dying, then retreat now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.68,0:14:33.56,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I-I cannot!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.56,0:14:36.19,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I won't let you lay a finger \Non Olka or the others!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.48,0:14:39.43,main,Glasses,0,0,0,,Sucks being at the bottom \Nof the ladder, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.43,0:14:42.67,main,Glasses,0,0,0,,If you'll yield, I don't mind giving you a cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.67,0:14:44.61,main,Glasses,0,0,0,,I'd rather not get hurt anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.61,0:14:46.69,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I don't want a cut! Don't be ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.69,0:14:48.35,main,Glasses,0,0,0,,I'm not being ridiculous, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.35,0:14:50.44,main,Glasses,0,0,0,,This is a very serious business discussion.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.44,0:14:54.19,main,Glasses,0,0,0,,You're just like us. You put \Nfood on your table by killing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.46,0:14:56.88,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Don't compare me to you! I'm—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.40,0:15:00.92,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm doing this to support my family... wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.92,0:15:03.06,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I guess I am also doing this for money.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.06,0:15:05.57,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,But... no, I make enough to survive now...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.57,0:15:07.49,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm hunting down bad guys for my country!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.90,0:15:09.62,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,For my country?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.62,0:15:12.72,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Have I always been so righteous?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.72,0:15:15.15,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,What am I doing this for?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.40,0:15:20.43,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, no—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.07,0:15:43.05,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, dear. He might actually \Nkill me. What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.05,0:15:48.08,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Now I won't be able to get Loid's \Nshirts from the cleaners.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.35,0:15:52.34,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I also won't be able to return \NMiss Anya's library books.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.34,0:15:55.09,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Wait, what am I even saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.75,0:16:00.10,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Why is this gentleman pointing \Na giant sword at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.00,0:16:03.11,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,My head hurts...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.60,0:16:06.14,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I think I'm a bit tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.14,0:16:08.85,flashback,Yuri,0,0,0,,Sis! Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.85,0:16:12.62,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh... I'm starting to see visions of Yuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.62,0:16:16.78,flashbacktop,Yuri,0,0,0,,Yahoo-hoo! Sis! I received an unofficial \Noffer from foreign affairs!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.26,0:16:18.12,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Aw, Yuri... you've grown up so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.12,0:16:20.11,flashbacktop,Yuri,0,0,0,,I bought this with my first paycheck!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.44,0:16:21.90,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,You can survive on your own without my help.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.11,0:16:21.17,flashbacktop,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, my!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.38,0:16:25.25,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I don't need to kill for a living anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.74,0:16:26.63,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.22,0:16:29.09,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Let's end this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.46,0:16:34.13,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,After all, if I die, I won't be able \Nto go to the cleaners or the library.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.66,0:16:37.64,main,Katana Guy,0,0,0,,It's over. Finish off Olka and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.64,0:16:38.64,main,Glasses,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.05,0:16:43.06,main,Yor,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.06,0:16:44.15,main,Katana Guy,0,0,0,,You little...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.15,0:16:45.62,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Olka?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.62,0:16:49.90,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Olka. Why was I acting \Nas her bodyguard again?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.88,0:16:53.91,flashback,Olka,0,0,0,,I just want to live a quiet, peaceful life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.90,0:16:59.68,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.19,0:17:04.54,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,The reason I started this job... \Nand continued this job...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.95,0:17:08.47,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Life had gotten so hectic that \NI had completely forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.49,0:17:12.36,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Was it for money? For my country?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.95,0:17:15.22,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,It was, but it wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.81,0:17:17.43,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.43,0:17:21.43,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I just wanted to protect his simple life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.84,0:17:26.26,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,There are many unreasonable \Nsacrifices in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.26,0:17:28.01,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,To make sure I don't add to them...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.01,0:17:29.83,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,To reduce that number by even one...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.83,0:17:31.75,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I need to thoroughly cleanse this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.13,0:17:34.10,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Things are not going to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.10,0:17:37.21,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,No... Now more than ever...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.12,0:17:45.28,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I don't need peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.13,0:17:48.47,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I don't care if there is blood on these hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.99,0:17:53.71,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Even if I live a life in which I'm \Nbound to be killed sooner or later...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.22,0:18:03.23,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Even if I have to leave the Forgers...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.96,0:18:06.22,flashback,Loid,0,0,0,,Be it for someone else,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.78,0:18:10.10,flashback,Loid,0,0,0,,or for a specific reason,\Nhaving to endure a merciless job...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.50,0:18:12.16,flashback,Loid,0,0,0,,That's something to be very proud of.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.81,0:18:16.28,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm sure Loid will acknowledge me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.76,0:18:17.73,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,He'll forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.17,0:18:34.25,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I will not give up...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.15,0:18:36.41,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,this fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.10,0:18:54.98,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,The bright crimson that \Nappears right before my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.70,0:19:04.91,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Stretches approximately 40,000 kilometers
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.04,0:19:12.75,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Our wounds that inch closer behind us
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.75,0:19:17.84,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Make us wander even more \Nwhen we're already lost
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.84,0:19:22.43,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,The unseeable, scentless, unmistakable future
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.43,0:19:24.35,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Stabbed me in the back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.35,0:19:25.51,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.51,0:19:35.07,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Let me stay by your side tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.07,0:19:42.78,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Just for tonight, I'm going to be serious
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.07,0:19:46.62,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Come closer to me
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.62,0:19:48.91,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Even the future we prayed for
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.91,0:19:50.96,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Has a different path
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.96,0:19:54.50,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,My dear
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.05,0:19:58.55,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Our malice for each other
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.55,0:20:01.84,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Might just get to us
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.22,0:20:06.43,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Or maybe not
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.93,0:20:09.68,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(63,90)\fscx98)}Sis's Herb Tea
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.51,0:20:12.39,main,Lieutenant,0,0,0,,He went around the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.39,0:20:13.98,main,Lieutenant,0,0,0,,We're going to surround him, Yuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.98,0:20:14.69,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.36,0:20:28.97,main,Lieutenant,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Yuri?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.97,0:20:30.55,main,Lieutenant,0,0,0,,Did the suspect get you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.45,0:20:33.96,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Sir... it appears that...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.96,0:20:35.79,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,I caught a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.63,0:20:37.90,main,Lieutenant,0,0,0,,Out of nowhere?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.00,0:20:42.51,main,Lieutenant,0,0,0,,It's rare for you to get sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.51,0:20:43.75,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,When I...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.87,0:20:48.68,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,When I think about my sister not \Nbeing around, my cells grow weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.22,0:20:51.72,main,Lieutenant,0,0,0,,Oh, right. She's on a business \Ntrip right now, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.72,0:20:52.82,main,Lieutenant,0,0,0,,On that cruise.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.82,0:20:55.20,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I let the suspect get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.45,0:20:57.65,main,Lieutenant,0,0,0,,Just get some rest. \NI'm going to the drug store.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.65,0:20:59.09,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Oh, wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.09,0:21:01.66,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Could you also get me some herbal tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.66,0:21:03.44,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,The one with the bear on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.44,0:21:04.64,main,Lieutenant,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.75,0:21:10.95,italics,Yuri,0,0,0,,Whenever I get a cold, \NI remember when I was little...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.55,0:21:14.45,flashback,Young Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, no! You have a fever, Yuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.45,0:21:17.13,flashback,Young Yor,0,0,0,,What should I do? What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.13,0:21:18.89,flashback,Young Yuri,0,0,0,,Calm down, Sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.89,0:21:20.96,flashback,Young Yuri,0,0,0,,I'll be fine if I get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.96,0:21:23.46,flashback,Young Yor,0,0,0,,First things first! You need to stay warm!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.46,0:21:25.28,flashback,Young Yor,0,0,0,,I'll put every piece of cloth we have over you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.45,0:21:26.46,flashback,Young Yuri,0,0,0,,Heavy! That's too heavy, Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.46,0:21:29.22,flashback,Young Yor,0,0,0,,Apparently, in the far east, they wrap \Ngreen onions around their necks!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.22,0:21:30.97,flashback,Young Yuri,0,0,0,,I give! Sis, I give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.97,0:21:35.09,flashback,Nabor,0,0,0,,Nothin' beats herbal tea \Nwith some honey for colds.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.09,0:21:37.96,flashback,Nabor,0,0,0,,Try putting elderflower or sage in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.19,0:21:38.92,flashback,Young Yor,0,0,0,,Thanks, Mrs. Nabor!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.92,0:21:39.99,flashback,Young Yor,0,0,0,,I'm heading to the mountains now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.26,0:21:41.48,flashback,Young Yor,0,0,0,,I'm home, Yuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.48,0:21:44.11,flashback,Young Yor,0,0,0,,I picked up a bunch of things \Nthat are really good for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.11,0:21:46.49,flashback,Young Yuri,0,0,0,,Sis?! What in the world happened to you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.76,0:21:50.03,flashback,Young Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, I just accidentally made \Nsome bees mad, tee-hee.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.03,0:21:51.93,flashback,Young Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, and I fought a boar.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.93,0:21:53.30,flashback,Young Yor,0,0,0,,Let's make you some hotpot!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.30,0:21:55.38,flashback,Young Yor,0,0,0,,And I'll make you some \Nherbal tea right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.38,0:21:59.62,flashback italics,Young Yuri,0,0,0,,This isn't good... Me having a cold \Nputs my sister's life in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.62,0:22:02.10,flashback italics,Young Yuri,0,0,0,,I need to grow up big and strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.37,0:22:05.97,flashback,Young Yor,0,0,0,,Hurry up and get better, Yuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.97,0:22:08.63,flashback,Young Yor,0,0,0,,Hurry up and get better, Yuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.11,0:22:12.21,flashback,Young Yuri,0,0,0,,Hey, Sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.21,0:22:12.98,flashback,Young Yor,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.89,0:22:16.67,flashback,Young Yuri,0,0,0,,I'm really glad I'm your little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.81,0:22:22.90,flashback,Young Yor,0,0,0,,Goodness, don't talk like you're going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.47,0:22:24.53,flashback,Young Yuri,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.20,0:22:30.24,flashback,Young Yor,0,0,0,,I'm glad I have you by my side, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.24,0:22:32.21,flashback,Young Yor,0,0,0,,Stay happy and healthy forever, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.21,0:22:33.03,flashback,Young Yuri,0,0,0,,Sis...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.12,0:22:39.17,flashback italics,Young Yuri,0,0,0,,I need to make this world gentler... \Nsomeday, for my gentle sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.00,0:22:43.63,flashback,Young Yor,0,0,0,,Here. Drink this and get better soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.63,0:22:45.05,flashback,Young Yuri,0,0,0,,I will, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.69,0:22:51.31,flashback,Young Yuri,0,0,0,,This sure warms you right up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.31,0:22:52.56,flashback,Young Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.56,0:22:54.64,flashback,Young Yuri,0,0,0,,There's so much going on\Nin my body right now
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.64,0:22:57.75,flashback,Young Yuri,0,0,0,,that I'm not worried about my \Ncold symptoms at all anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.20,0:22:59.56,flashback,Young Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.88,0:23:05.44,main,Lieutenant,0,0,0,,You all right? You wouldn't \Nstop moaning in your sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.05,0:23:07.99,main,Lieutenant,0,0,0,,I bought the stuff you asked for.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.99,0:23:09.64,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.98,0:23:12.94,main,Lieutenant,0,0,0,,This stuff is famous for tasting awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.45,0:23:12.95,sign_31457_339_The_medicine__po,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&HB6DFDD&\3c&H8C99C0&\bord4\fs20\pos(450,20)\b0}Mr. Bear\NCold and Flu
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.23,0:23:15.96,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,It works the best for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.44,0:23:19.71,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,It also tastes the most similar to \Nwhat my sister would make for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.52,0:23:24.14,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,All right! All better!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.14,0:23:25.78,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Let's go catch that suspect!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.78,0:23:28.68,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,I'm going to purify the world \Nbefore my sister gets back!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.68,0:23:29.67,main,Lieutenant,0,0,0,,Stay in bed!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.93,0:23:39.93,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(447,280)\fscx32}The Hand That Connects to the Future
